    "description": "**** SAMPLE DATA **** NEW LOW PRICE! This 2-bedroom+, 2-bath home is now priced to account for its as-is condition, including deferred maintenance. The flexible floor-plan offers bonus rooms, perfect for a home office, extra bedroom, or flex space to suit your needs. With southern exposure and year-round access on county-maintained roads, you'll enjoy stunning views of snow-capped peaks up Rollins Pass. Located within walking distance of a local brewery, coffee shop, and a wood-fired pizza spot with popular happy hour deals, this home is all about convenience and charm. The local Stage Stop is also undergoing exciting renovations, creating even more buzz in the neighborhood. Just a short drive to downtown Nederland, Eldora Ski Resort, and outdoor activities like hiking, biking, and snowshoeing trails, this property is perfect for those seeking the Colorado lifestyle. The location offers the option of attending Boulder Valley or Gilpin school districts and benefits from lower property taxes. This home is sold as-is and includes an easement for shared access with the neighboring property. Bring your vision to transform this rustic retreat into your dream home! **** SAMPLE DATA ****",
